sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Client App (Wasm)
    participant GW as Edge Gateway
    participant S3 as Private S3 Bucket (AES-256)

    Client->>Client: Extract Landmarks & Quality Check (Wasm)
    Client->>Client: Redraw to Canvas (EXIF Metadata Stripped)
    Client->>GW: POST /api/v1/captures/upload-url (captureId, size, type)
    GW->>GW: Verify auth.uid() & Active Biometric Consent
    GW->>GW: Generate S3 Key: `facial-captures/{auth.uid()}/{captureId}.jpg`
    GW-->>Client: 201 Created (HMAC Signed PUT URL, 15m TTL)
    Client->>S3: PUT /facial-captures/... (Binary JPEG, Content-Type: image/jpeg)
    S3-->>Client: 200 OK (ETag Verified)
